WEBVTT

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:06.380
Over here!

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:08.130
Get back here!

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:14.260
Go, Driger!

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.890
Get a load of that!

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:28.080
Takao's on fire.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:32.250
He has perfect control
over Dragoon Metal Storm.

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:37.800
He has to.
We can't lose another match.

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:44.120
And the last two opponents are people neither Kai nor Yuriy could handle.

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:47.720
Come on, Rai!
This is the end for us!

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:49.810
Watch your mouth!

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:53.290
Right, sorry.
This really is it, then.

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:56.420
Sorry!
If only I had won...

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:59.760
Takao!
I'll fight you next!

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.180
Me too!

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.220
Sure!

00:03:03.170 --> 00:03:04.960
Here I come, Takao!

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:06.500
We won't hold back!

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.370
Yeah, don't hold back!

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:17.440
Go!

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:37.970
This is all we
can do now, Takao.

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:42.800
All we can do
is practice with you!

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:50.060
Now this is what
I'm talkin' about!

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:55.530
Sorry, but I can't
allow myself to lose!

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:58.000
Send 'em flying, Dragoon!

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:03.420
Damn!

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:05.380
Look!

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:08.440
You're too easy, Takao!

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:09.400
What?!

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.920
Don't drop your guard!

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.280
Don't drop my guard...

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:34.360
Thanks, Daichi!

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:44.570
Alright! One more!

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:46.380
Rick! Please!

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.250
My turn, huh?

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:52.660
You're still going, Takao?

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:55.390
You've had enough!

00:04:55.610 --> 00:05:00.580
I'm fine! I can't beat them if
this is all it takes to wear me out!

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:06.320
But it won't do you any good if you wear
yourself out before tomorrow's match!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:10.020
I have to!
I just have to!

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:12.300
Takao...

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:16.680
Sorry. Either way,
I want to keep practicing.

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.260
Please!

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.730
Sounds good to me.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.580
And Rock Bison's
itching for a fight too!

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:30.320
Don't worry about tomorrow.
I'll let this bad boy loose on 'em!

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:33.740
I'm gonna take a
win offa BEGA!

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:36.540
Rick!

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:44.440
Or are you planning on fighting two matches
tomorrow despite that Mister X stuff?

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:50.460
Don't be shy, now!
Just let me handle it!

00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:01.260
Thank you, Rick.
Thank you all!

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:04.010
But I have to
do this alone.

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:09.180
I'm the one who challenged
BEGA in the first place!

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.220
Takao!

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:16.760
I knew it!

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:20.740
Is he actually planning on
playing two matches tomorrow?

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:26.140
Everyone here is
a top-class Blader!

00:06:26.140 --> 00:06:30.320
But our remaining opponents are BEGA's best Bladers!

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:35.820
We don't stand a chance
without the Heavy Metal Beys!

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:37.250
No...

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:40.170
But that's
exactly my point!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:43.530
He needs to rest a
little for tomorrow!

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:48.050
Not like Takao's gonna
listen to us anyway!

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:50.410
Takao!

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:53.050
If only he was here...

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:55.260
He?

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:59.210
Oh, don't worry about it...

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:01.730
We just...

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.460
Have to trust him.

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:06.250
Trust that the
G-Revolutions can win!

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:24.340
After the first day of the Justice 5,
BEGA comes out with two wins and a draw!

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:29.090
The G-Revolutions are on the edge!
They have no more losses afforded to them!

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:32.420
Not even ties!

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:40.420
The second day will have the BEGA ace Garland, and the genius Blader known as Brooklyn!

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:44.930
The G-Revolutions are
in huge trouble!

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:51.800
Who will join Takao Kinomiya
to fight against them?

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:17.800
Dranzer!!

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.940
Look out!

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:50.890
The future of Beyblading is
riding on these matches!

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:55.600
The Justice 5 is the showdown between
BEGA and the G-Revolutions!

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:59.340
BEGA has won two of the past
three matches, with one draw!

00:08:59.340 --> 00:09:08.640
Will Garland the ace and the Brooklyn the rookie
genius finish off the G-Revolutions for good?

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:10.520
The pros are in
a different league.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:11.920
BEGA's that good.

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:15.840
So who do the G-Revolutions
have left? Takao and who else?

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:17.650
That Mister X guy.

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:20.160
Whoever they have
won't be able to win.

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:23.340
Here's a live feed
straight from BEGA!

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:29.640
It's Ming-Ming, who fought an amazing
battle in the first round of the Justice 5!

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:34.780
Hey there!
I'm Ming-Ming!

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:36.460
How's it going out there?

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:37.520
It's Ming-Ming!

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:40.410
She's just way
too darn cute!

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:47.050
You fought a great
battle, Ming-Ming.

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:50.020
Are all the BEGA
members in top shape?

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:55.060
Thank you! It's all thanks to our supportive BEGA fans!

00:09:55.060 --> 00:10:02.240
We're all at the top of our game!
But we're pros, so that's a given!

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:10.100
Cheer for BEGA in these last two matches! The future of Beyblade, like, belongs to us!

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:14.680
Because we're pros, huh?
She's exactly right.

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:18.280
Go, Apollon!

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:25.930
Defeat is not an option.

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:31.360
Both as BEGA's ace, and for the honor of the Siebald family!

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.780
Battle me again!

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:41.620
Things are advancing as smoothly--no, even more smoothly than I expected.

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.260
What of Brooklyn?

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:47.780
Ahh, err, well, he
was just here earlier.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:52.370
No matter. Leave him be.

00:10:56.740 --> 00:11:02.080
Oh, geniuses. It's hard to even
imagine what goes through his head.

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:10.200
But the power of his genius will
swat some annoying flies for me.

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:18.100
Including a very annoying fly
known as the world champion.

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:22.490
And that will mark
the end for them.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:27.660
My long awaited dream of controlling
Beyblading will become a reality.

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:37.980
Ciao!

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:46.120
Tres bien!

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:48.980
Ciao!

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:52.720
But first, a little snack.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:07.950
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:22.780
Dranzer!

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:54.250
Why?!
Why won't it listen to me?!

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:56.860
Why?!

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:05.040
Now here's someone you
don't see every day...

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:14.960
I will never give up!

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:19.690
Go, Dranzer!!

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:24.620
What?!

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:31.040
Looks like you're up to something fun.
Are. You. Not?

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:36.330
Whoa there.
Don't give me that look.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:39.940
I was just thinking it'd be
nice to battle once in a while.

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:42.930
Battle? Forget it!

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:45.820
Now, now.
Don't be such a prune.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:52.120
I started feeling sorry for you after
watching that boorish practice session.

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:56.340
So allow the genius known as
Romero to show you the ropes.

00:13:56.340 --> 00:13:59.690
Piss off! I don't have
time to play with you!

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:05.220
I wouldn't take me so lightly if I were you.
As you are now, you have no hope of beating me.

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:06.760
What was that?

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:10.450
If you disagree then show me
what you've got, garçon.

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:20.880
Make your move.

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:24.360
Don't toy with me!
Dranzer!

00:14:29.780 --> 00:14:31.570
Over here.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:42.500
You've got a long road ahead
if you can't even keep up with me.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:43.980
What?!

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:48.100
Don't you want to
beat that Brooklyn kid?

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:49.450
Brooklyn?!

00:14:54.220 --> 00:14:58.250
This isn't a gap you can
clear with hard work.

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:01.850
You will never reach him.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:05.020
I might even say
this is god's domain.

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:09.460
God's domain?!

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:11.890
You can't be serious!

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:26.930
What happened?

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:32.840
I see! This...

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:35.900
Oh my.
You caught on?

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:38.440
One more round.
Get ready!

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:40.840
You never learn.

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:42.830
Here I come!

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:42.840
After you!
Here I come!

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:44.130
After you!

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.020
Go!

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:49.280
He hit me!

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:56.100
Unleash your rage, Dranzer!

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:58.930
Unleash more rage!

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:02.050
Roar, Dranzer!

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:06.330
Uh-oh...

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:14.240
Kai Hiwatari's impressive,
I'll give him that.

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:19.160
What took the others days to figure out, he learned in a matter of minutes.

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:27.600
Now it's over.

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:33.850
That's right. This Bey responds to the Blader's emotions more so than anything before it.

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:37.570
But launching it is only
a part of the equation.

00:16:38.340 --> 00:16:40.540
That's what battle is.

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:44.840
La Vie en Rose!!

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:51.730
What?!

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:16.400
Attacks fueled by rage will play
right into that genius boy's hands.

00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:20.420
By the way, you can call me
genius boy too, if you like.

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:25.090
You think I'll
accept that?! Never!

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:26.820
How stubborn of you.

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:29.360
Then why don't
you try and escape?

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:46.970
Even so...

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:50.740
I will...

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:56.460
Hey, come on.
Why do you hate him so much?

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:59.770
I will never accept him!

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:01.660
Why won't you?

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:07.410
Bladers like him do exist, you know.
What's the real reason?

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:10.320
The real reason?

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:12.850
I just... I...

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:33.980
That's it. I... No, we...

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:40.960
There's someone I
want to fight again!

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:45.010
Someone I'm willing to
sacrifice everything to defeat!

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:49.190
Our battles mean much
more than this!

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:56.280
Which is why I can't allow
myself to give up now!

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:01.660
Let's go, Dranzer!

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:24.880
Impressive.
You're amazing.

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:28.100
But I want you
to remember this.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:32.880
Dranzer has the souls of
your friends imbued it.

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:38.340
Get on out there.
You know what's next.

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:42.010
Where you need to go.
What you need to do.

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:45.610
Don't worry about
little 'ol me.

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:49.400
But if you insist, I'll--

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:52.920
Oh well.

00:19:55.680 --> 00:20:00.340
The banana in my shirt got squashed!
What a mess!

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:03.090
This is my only shirt!

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:05.840
I need to go fishing too!
And what about dinner?!

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:09.500
He messed up my schedule!

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:20.780
Come on! One more!

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:23.250
Still?

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:25.600
I'm at my limit!

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:30.280
Let's take a break.
This is too much!

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:33.690
Takao, we're begging you!
Listen to us!

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:36.580
Hiromi! Guys!

00:20:37.890 --> 00:20:41.880
Sorry!
But I can't stop now!

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:43.570
I can't...

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:34.970
You're late.

00:22:55.980 --> 00:22:59.520
We're counting on you
for the next match, Kai!

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:02.290
I just know you can win!

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:05.970
You want to play again?
The result won't change.

00:23:05.970 --> 00:23:08.560
If you insist...

00:23:08.560 --> 00:23:11.250
See? Get it now?

00:23:11.250 --> 00:23:14.810
You can't change the future,
no matter how hard you work.

00:23:14.810 --> 00:23:16.810
Nothing changes.

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:21.200
Huh? Why?
If you keep fighting, you'll...
